            <ArticleTitle>Gastric duplication cyst presenting as an acute abdomen in a child.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1152</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Gastric duplication cysts are rare. The usual presentation is an abdominal mass with vomiting. In this article we report on a case presenting as an acute abdomen.</AbstractText>
